# The two canonical November 2008 archives are committed since 20 September 2026 (artifacts/nov08/, 65 KB, the
# five-file pre-release its author sent, MIT-licensed by their author) so the base every NOV08-SOURCE claim rests on
# is reachable from this repository, as the January archives are from genesis/: outside reviews found half of the
# laboratory's stated scope obtainable only from a third party's host. manifests/EXPECTED_CHECKSUMS.json carries
# SNI's md5/sha1 and this laboratory's sha256 over the committed bytes. Other archive forms stay out.
/artifacts/**/*.tar.gz
/artifacts/**/*.zip
/artifacts/**/*.part

# Extracted original trees remain local until licensing/provenance policy is finalized.
/extracted/

# Redundant local bootstrap archive (scaffold is now materialized in-tree)
/original-bitcoin-laboratory-bootstrap.zip

# Generated manifests and test outputs
/manifests/LOCAL_SHA256SUMS
/reports/
/build/
*.log
__pycache__/
.pytest_cache/
.DS_Store

# Credentials. Added 12 Aug 2026, before any token existed rather than after one leaked:
# a bearer token is billable and identifies an account, and "it got committed" is the
# failure mode that only becomes live the moment you first hold one.
.env
.env.*
*.token
BLOCKSTREAM_TOKEN*
